-Q ../base/theories GTBase
-arg -w -arg -notation-overridden

theories/foundations/chi_bounding.v
# poly_forms.v converts between the two encodings of "polynomially chi-bounded"
# (X3.v's coefficient list vs chi_bounding.v's c * omega ^ d normal form), so it
# sits after X3.v in the dependency order computed by coqdep.
theories/foundations/poly_forms.v
# forest_paths.v: every path of a forest is induced (needed by the X218 e041 edge).
theories/foundations/forest_paths.v
# critical.v: criticality helpers for the chromatic number (U1/X213 e228 edge).
theories/foundations/critical.v

# choice_number.v: existence of the choice number ch(G) -- palette canonicalisation
# turns [choosable G k] into a boolean over the fixed palette 'I_(k * #|G|), so that
# [ex_minn] applies (U1/X7 e004 edge, U4 e039).
theories/foundations/choice_number.v
# edge_colourings.v: K_n as a loopless multigraph, line-graph choosability ->
# edge-choosability, and chi'(K_n) <= n-1 for even n (round robin) (X219 e039 edge).
theories/foundations/edge_colourings.v
# partial_lists.v: existence of lambda_t (partial list colouring) by palette
# canonicalisation (U4 e000 edge).
theories/foundations/partial_lists.v

